{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、いよいよ、今日でプリンシパルも大千秋楽を\n迎えます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"稽古から早二ヶ月、\n長かったプリンシパルも\n今日で終わり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さみしいけれど、\n次へ進みたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"役を勝ち取るだけじゃない、\n役以外にもたくさん、\n確実に得たものはありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後、どんな形で終わりたいか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怪我なく無事に終わればいいかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガジ頑張ります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、とりあえず乃木坂最高ー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2013/06/02/4351646/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2013/06/02/4351646/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いってきます！"}],"source":"archive"}